      "title": "实测一次运行",
      "items": [
        "subscribers('news')=2 · subscribers('alerts')=1",
        "Publish('news', …) → sent to 2 subs；Publish('unknown') → 0",
        "unsub 后 subscribers('news')=1，再发布只 sent to 1 subs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "发布三原则",
      "items": [
        "RLock 读订阅列表：多个 Publish 可并行",
        "先 copy 再发送：锁内不做 channel 发送",
        "select + default：慢订阅者不拖垮发布者（丢消息语义）"
